	</div>
	<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
		<p>Campbell Hausfeld and Maxus have products you can count on &#8211; all day, every day. MAXUS tools and equipment are designed for pros like you, people who make their living using tools on the job site. </p>
		<img class="img-thumbnail" alt="Campbell Hausfeld air compressors" src="~/images/site/Campbell-Hausfeld-Logo.jpg">
		<p>MAXUS products include air compressors, air-powered nailers, air tools, pressure washers and welders. Maxus tools and equipment are designed to help pros like you be more productive on the job. We want to help you finish your jobs faster and easier - all day, every day.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<h4>Standard Features</h4>
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-sm-4">
				<ul>
					<li>Heavy-duty cast iron compressor pump Made in the USA </li>
					<li>Splash Lubricated</li>
					<li>Belt driven with a large flywheel for extra cooling and easier start-up</li>
					<li>Directional air shroud for reduced pump temperatures </li>
					<li>Totally enclosed heavy-duty belt guard </li>
					<li>Tanks are powder coated and ASME certified </li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-4">
				<ul>
					<li>Manual tank drain(s)</li>
					<li>Large canister intake filter with replaceable filter elements</li>
					<li>Special unloading valves to assist in motor starting </li>
					<li>Tank gauge</li>
					<li>Pressure relief safety valve</li>
					<li>Magnetic starter is included on all 5HPand larger units </li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-4">
				<ul>
					<li>Protectively mounted fittings</li>
					<li>Industrial/Commercial grade UL Listed electric motor</li>
					<li>Thermal overload motor protection</li>
					<li>Alternator and magnetic starter are standard on all duplex models</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<div class="media">
					<img class="media-object" alt="One gallon electric compressor" src="~/store/images/product/icon/EX1001.jpg" height="150" width="150">
					<div class="media-body">
						<h4 class="media-heading">Maxus .5HP One Gallon Finishing and Trim Compressor - EX1001</h4>
						<p>The Maxus EX1001, manufactured by Campbell Hausfeld, is a powerful 1/2 HP air compressor that features an induction motor which operates quietly. This air compressor is ideal for punch-out, trim, and finish applications. The Maintenance-free pump does not require oil, and the one-gallon low profile tank is lightweight and easy to store. This compressor is great for the homeowner and the do-it-yourselfer.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<hr />
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<div class="media">
					 <img class="media-object" alt="EX8000 Maxus compressor" src="~/store/images/product/icon/EX8000.jpg" height="152" width="150"> 
					<div class="media-body">
						<h4 class="media-heading">Maxus 2HP Four Gallon Twin Tank Portable Compressor - EX8000</h4>
						<p>This maintenance-free 4 gallon compressor offers great output, while still easy-to-start in cold weather. The control panel is easy-to-read and helps protect the pump/motor during transport and use. This is most commonly sold to homeowners and small contractors who need occasional air, but not everyday. </p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<hr></hr>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<div class="media">
					<img class="media-object" alt="Hand carry portable air compressor" src="~/store/images/product/icon/EX8002.jpg" height="150" width="97">
					<div class="media-body">
						<h4 class="media-heading">Maxus 2.5HP Four Gallon Pancake Style Air Compressor - EX8002</h4>
						<p>This pancake-style air compressor is powerful enough to run multiple brad, finish, framing or roofing nailers at the same time. Its quiet, induction-style motor makes it a good unit to use indoors as well as outdoors. The convenient handle slightly tilts the compressor away from your body, so it does not hit the knees when transporting the compressor around the jobsite. </p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<hr />
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<div class="media">
					<img class="media-object" alt="Wheeled Maxus / Campbell Hausfeld 26 gallons tank" src="~/store/images/product/icon/EX8300.jpg" height="119" width="150">
					<div class="media-body">
						<h4 class="media-heading">Maxus 2HP 20 Gallons Wheelbarrow Compressor - EX8300</h4>
						<p>This Maxus EX8300 Air compressor is able to provide up to 5,000 hours of pump life (based on a B-10 bearing rate), and features a design that is able to run 35% quieter and lasts longer because the EX8300 is able to run 60 cooler. The wheels offer ultimate portability when moving around the job, and its low profile design makes it easy to fit in cars and trucks. </p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<hr />
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<div class="media">
					<img class="media-object" alt="Vertical wheeled compressor " src="~/store/images/product/icon/EX8008.jpg" height="150" width="73">
					<div class="media-body">
						<h4 class="media-heading">Maxus 5HP 26 Gallon Vertical Wheeled Compressor - EX8008</h4>
						<p>If you need a space-saving portable air compressor, this is the compressor for you. The 26 Gallon, 2.0 Running HP, vertical cast iron compressor powers a variety of air tools for the serious professional. The product`s pump life is up to 5,000 hours for years of safe operation. The large 26-gallon tank with a handle and two large wheels allows you to move on the jobsite in seconds. With 5.5 CFM of air delivery and a maximum pressure of 135 PSI, you have plenty of air flow to easily get the job done.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<hr></hr>
			</div>
